Ninja Point of Sale (POS) created in Pascal (Lazarus). It allows selling products in a simple way.

It has three main components:

1. Product Management System.
2. Sales System.
3. Reports System.
4. _ESC POS_ Printers System.

All of them are programs created using _Lazarus Pascal_ and they work on Windows, Linux and MacOS environments.

*Note*

Since all the systems share a _SQLite_ database, only one program can be opened at a time.

